  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-09T13:32:42.432Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When a favorited avatar is removed you lose any ability to find the author to potentially make a deal with them to buy that avatar from them, or even to find similar avatars that they might have publicly available.\n\nAs VRChat moves toward a creator economy, it will be important for people to be able to make these connections. Please persist the name and profile of a removed avatar's author for some amount of time after an avatar is removed.",
